 175966-2    user       afid             MO     2     2.97/3.00/2.39   1205.26    413.02   146.21  1.04  99           0.1164   0.0     21.0  ---           ---     ---
 175966-1    user       afid             MT     2     2.62/2.60/2.37   1234.41    369.90   142.63  1.02  91           0.1265   0.0     19.7  ---           ---     ---
